# This example demonstrates WebSocket communication over HTTP/3 (RFC 9220).
#
# It starts a local HttpServer with a QUIC (HTTP/3) listener and a WebSocket
# echo handler, then connects a WebSocketClient over HTTP/3 and exchanges
# text and binary messages.
#
# Usage:
#   qore websocket-h3-echo.qr
#
# The script uses a hardcoded self-signed certificate for TLS (required by QUIC).
# No external services are needed.

%requires HttpServer
%requires WebSocketHandler
%requires WebSocketClient

